{"4523340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "C.U.B.E", "steam_appid": 4523340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Help your friends survive... just not better than you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C.U.B.E (CUBE) is an online 1–6 player co-op horror game where you'll work together to survive ten days of deadly Trials while competing to keep your own death count lower than everyone else's. At the end of Day 10, one player is chosen as the True Subject... then the Final Evaluation begins</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive The Trials</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Trial introduces a completely different challenge. Solve puzzles, survive bizarre experiments, navigate deadly environments, and adapt to whatever the facility throws at you next. No two days are ever the same. The trial pool is currently comprised of 25 unique trials with plans for many more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523340/extras/70451d3f456f1c40d0bb67e7573fcbf3.poster.avif?t=1787331615\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523340/extras/70451d3f456f1c40d0bb67e7573fcbf3.webm?t=1787331615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523340/extras/70451d3f456f1c40d0bb67e7573fcbf3.mp4?t=1787331615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trust No One</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends on teamwork, but only one player can become the True Subject. Work together to overcome each Trial while competing to keep your own death count lower than everyone else's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523340/extras/653cfdc0030886c1a0e00f24b28af0b5.poster.avif?t=1787331615\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523340/extras/653cfdc0030886c1a0e00f24b28af0b5.webm?t=1787331615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523340/extras/653cfdc0030886c1a0e00f24b28af0b5.mp4?t=1787331615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Final Evaluation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After ten days, one player is chosen as the True Subject. The rest? You'll have one final chance to take the title for yourselves in the Final Evaluation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523340/extras/743a17e8856ac2119f9f6b465ddc85de.poster.avif?t=1787331615\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523340/extras/743a17e8856ac2119f9f6b465ddc85de.webm?t=1787331615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523340/extras/743a17e8856ac2119f9f6b465ddc85de.mp4?t=1787331615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dress To Impress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We couldn't send you into the trials looking boring now could we?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523340/extras/8db3f64722030a8d83e97e05469b76d0.poster.avif?t=1787331615\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523340/extras/8db3f64722030a8d83e97e05469b76d0.webm?t=1787331615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523340/extras/8db3f64722030a8d83e97e05469b76d0.mp4?t=1787331615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Online co-op for 1-6 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 25 Unique Trials &amp; Plans For Many More!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Randomised runs with high replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A huge variety of items to discover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Proximity voice chat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hilarious physics and ragdoll moments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Character cosmetics and unlockables</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Full single-player support, though CUBE is best experienced with others</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Steam Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Private and Public lobbies</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Help your friends survive... just not better than you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C.U.B.E (CUBE) is an online 1–6 player co-op horror game where you'll work together to survive ten days of deadly Trials while competing to keep your own death count lower than everyone else's. At the end of Day 10, one player is chosen as the True Subject... then the Final Evaluation begins</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive The Trials</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Trial introduces a completely different challenge. Solve puzzles, survive bizarre experiments, navigate deadly environments, and adapt to whatever the facility throws at you next. No two days are ever the same. The trial pool is currently comprised of 25 unique trials with plans for many more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523340/extras/70451d3f456f1c40d0bb67e7573fcbf3.poster.avif?t=1787331615\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523340/extras/70451d3f456f1c40d0bb67e7573fcbf3.webm?t=1787331615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523340/extras/70451d3f456f1c40d0bb67e7573fcbf3.mp4?t=1787331615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trust No One</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends on teamwork, but only one player can become the True Subject. Work together to overcome each Trial while competing to keep your own death count lower than everyone else's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523340/extras/653cfdc0030886c1a0e00f24b28af0b5.poster.avif?t=1787331615\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523340/extras/653cfdc0030886c1a0e00f24b28af0b5.webm?t=1787331615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523340/extras/653cfdc0030886c1a0e00f24b28af0b5.mp4?t=1787331615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Final Evaluation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After ten days, one player is chosen as the True Subject. The rest? You'll have one final chance to take the title for yourselves in the Final Evaluation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523340/extras/743a17e8856ac2119f9f6b465ddc85de.poster.avif?t=1787331615\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/